Animal sprites
    15x15 (fly) and 19x19 (fish) grow, flicker, and shrink PNG frames under
    app/utils/sprites/fly and fish, in an east-facing and a down-right version
    (n.png and n_d.png). Drawn by organic_sprites.py in that folder from
    shapes, in the colors of app/palette.js. A neon set is kept beside them in
    cyber-fly and cyber-fish. MIT with the rest of this repo. Served from that
    folder, PNG only.

World capitals
